OL,3,GNEWSACall for 'accountability' on #5m
OL,4,Aempty market hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor is calling for people to
OL,7,Fbe held accountable over a market hall
OL,8,Fleft standing empty after a #5m
OL,9,Frefurbishment.
OL,11,FThe market hall in Newton Abbot closed
OL,12,Fin October 2024 for a massive
OL,13,Frefurbishment using more than #5m from
OL,14,Fthe government's Future High Streets
OL,15,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
