OL,3,GNEWSACall for 'accountability' on #5m
OL,4,Aempty market hall
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiberal Democrat-led Teignbridge
OL,7,FDistrict Council originally said the
OL,8,Frejuvenated building would be open for
OL,9,Fbusiness by "autumn" but then announced
OL,10,Fon social media in October that the
OL,11,F"earliest we'll be ready to go will be
OL,12,Fin the spring".
OL,14,FJane Taylor, leader of the Independent
OL,15,FGroup on the council, said the project
OL,16,Fhad been a "failure" and has brought
OL,17,Fthe issue for a debate at a full
OL,18,Fcouncil meeting on Thursday.
